#### Adding a new shared dictionary where none already exist

1. Place the cursor right before the very last closing curly bracket `}` in the file. *- red rectangle*

{{::il.Vscode_CodeSpellChecker_SharedDictionary_ConfigNew_1_img}}


2. Paste in the following text: *- yellow rectangle*

```JSON
,
"dictionaries": [
    "dictionary-name"
],
"dictionaryDefinitions": [
    {
        "name": "dictionary-name",
        "path": "../../sharedDictionary.txt"
    }
]
```

> Change both occurences of `dictionary-name` with a name you prefer for your dictionary.
> Change `"../../sharedDictionary.txt"` for the relative path from this file to the dictionary text file you created earlier.

{{::il.Vscode_CodeSpellChecker_SharedDictionary_ConfigNew_1_img}}


6. Format the file.

6. Save the file.


{{::vs.Vscode_JsonArray_CommaGoldenRule}}

